{"version":1,"content":"<p>李彩華接受廿四味成員李凱賢（Brian）訪談節目《九運會客室2》訪問。</p><p>她在節目中大方分享早年出道的辛酸史，除了剖白十幾歲便要獨力代父償還過百萬巨債、面對大耳窿追債的人情冷暖外，更驚爆曾遭同行同事提出無理要求的演藝圈潛規則內幕。</p><p>&lt;br/</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T08:22:28.814767+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T08:01:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T08:18:10.210420+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T08:18:10.210420+00:00","content_hash":"726b31459fd5df8633e70e936296ee0b11a7b65ee6d8311255cde24318e5705b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}